    "final_text": "I added the v2.4.0 release notes to the top of `RELEASE_NOTES.md`, dated 2026-10-20, and left ACME-421 out as you asked:\n\n```\n## v2.4.0 (2026-10-20)\n\n### Breaking changes\n- None.\n\n### Features\n- Export reports to CSV with the `report` command [ACME-412] (thanks @mira)\n- Uploads now retry automatically with backoff when the server is temporarily unavailable (HTTP 503) [ACME-415] (thanks @jonas)\n\n### Fixes\n- Fixed a crash when the config file is empty [ACME-419] (thanks @tom)\n- Fixed incorrect totals in the monthly summary for leap years [ACME-423] (thanks @priya)\n```\n\nACME-421 (removing the `--legacy` flag from sync) was the only breaking change, so that section now reads \"- None.\" and `--legacy` keeps working in this release. The older v2.3.0 and v2.2.0 entries are unchanged.",
